#: scenario3:scenario3_FD388E09_8B10_4CDF_8E5C_1549B97DC055
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75b6d6036bba98293ec2bb1efb13331415a915da26074399c31e1108cfbc884f
#. default-sha256: 3ca98547caaa34c106e717a8f36e78c83291f8151a36babbf126099f791d5566
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FD388E09_8B10_4CDF_8E5C_1549B97DC055"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫The Pacific Railroad’s “Last Spike” ceremony was drawing nearer by "
"the day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫――大陸横断鉄道の開通式典は、⟪k:6⟫日に日に近づいておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_10FBEF3D_2159_4CF1_B0E0_3CE07EF4BF2E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ca08a0e2f594fd7579cefc9cad9da00d7357a563207b490742f4570b80c7c8a
#. default-sha256: 9a64e6d48bfaf26d475fc1b721900f0e26b8abb0b3aebd7352ef0a3cd38c5aea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_10FBEF3D_2159_4CF1_B0E0_3CE07EF4BF2E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That day was, coincidentally, the deadline the two of them had set for themselves—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"Jacopo to confront his wife, and the White-Haired Girl to wait for him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫偶然にも、⟪k:1⟫お互いが区切りとした日でございます。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ヤコポは妻と向き合うために、"
"⟪k:4⟫妻はヤコポを待つために。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_49D5AE19_E4BA_4311_A29D_1D4FFF10B3ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8c01154024aafc6db72b4ee10be4c50c61129dd3a12935df026ad7f154e0b1b
#. default-sha256: 517746c029a51d0dd30e3ebb1f562eed9f422a2dca7647fc250cbff91c6eeae2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49D5AE19_E4BA_4311_A29D_1D4FFF10B3ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And as that day approached, she continued to write letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その間にも、⟪k:1⟫やはり手紙は続きます。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7236BB12_217D_4031_A3C7_DCFE8DEE849F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43aff47bc27e7a5a3367a77afdae7fc6ca423e87eab7f6a7a26b99e1ccfcef3b
#. default-sha256: e6a5d5756251d06dc70ccab09ac367fbb60535268d4fa9639cf3122727c15d6c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7236BB12_217D_4031_A3C7_DCFE8DEE849F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wrote the letters purely by force of habit,⟪k:1⟫despite having been worn visibly thin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘は、⟪k:1⟫弱り切った表情を浮かべながらも、⟪k:2⟫もはや習慣となってしまったその行為を"
"続けました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FBE7FD54_B9BA_41B4_9C1F_473C3A1FC584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40812b01cbc4f558b5d97574af61c50b7a1c5468a185c9da0c6c71aeca8cdbe0
#. default-sha256: 321150660eec5653d20284dd45ab180eded9f4ccf0667cb835fd6e1ff986aa9b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FBE7FD54_B9BA_41B4_9C1F_473C3A1FC584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I expect that she could not stop—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that the act of writing was all that kept her "
"from going mad."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫恐らく――、⟪k:1⟫手紙を書いていないと、⟪k:2⟫気が狂いそうになるのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DDEF16C4_2820_4312_A143_35094965C838
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dfe07718d21932f4bb63dc7a8cff14e03d838d4ee7df0312836128cc10a6b2e0
#. default-sha256: 4623f5b197cb57c170511631f31531d2e21aff8049208da194c26dd50c6d3785
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DDEF16C4_2820_4312_A143_35094965C838"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫By focusing her attention on another person through her letters, she was able to maintain "
"her grip on herself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫誰かのことを手紙を介して考え続けることで、⟪k:1⟫彼女は何とか自分を保っていたのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4CCA9C38_1121_4241_B109_6722D3A9183F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7803990d02ff03e49d83f9e05b4d72c873ac61fe5931bf9c3b9a2831dc7e7897
#. default-sha256: a1739747c07252cd6e5554aa8a3081387d8c24ba01e8d690646f9ec11f81316c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4CCA9C38_1121_4241_B109_6722D3A9183F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But that day would put an end to her suffering and despair.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫When the railroad was "
"completed, all their misunderstandings would be cleared up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫彼女の苦痛も絶望も、⟪k:2⟫これで終わるはずです。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫大陸横断鉄道が完成すれ"
"ば、⟪k:5⟫お互いの誤解もやっと解けて――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9FA08EFD_A6FB_4CC2_A94F_14E38A5A6665
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b64e973c9b554ab1aee05c783169f9ece376685b58c1eb728258da9b2dbb0a0
#. default-sha256: 4d4c2b75a2258070a7261ee5e4db71bf58bc4bc713f2d722225b12045a7ca2b9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9FA08EFD_A6FB_4CC2_A94F_14E38A5A6665"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They would return to the smiling, happy couple they had been when they were first married."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫新婚の時代と同じように、⟪k:1⟫笑い合うことの出来た二人へと戻れるはずなのですから。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D47C7A99_4FBB_4EC8_B49A_C33745E2AA47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afe83b49d94b528c2437fccf55566379da9f830687cb738d18e3842bf6501530
#. default-sha256: ae5fe0f8a824b179ee0df78c09ff95003fc6ca0f742d9356e0b09787b0c03e8d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D47C7A99_4FBB_4EC8_B49A_C33745E2AA47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The harsh winter would finally come to a close, melting away into the past and allowing them "
"to step into the future."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫凍りついた極寒の日々は、⟪k:1⟫温かみをもって氷解し――何もかもを過去のこととして、⟪k:2⟫未来に進"
"めるはず……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9A818C79_BCA8_46DB_8D77_99A0AB587962
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09c07379e55aadc3fa95df6af6d18e32d6f0138c7ecf2e8d2ed08eb586ee6693
#. default-sha256: 510ea5d7f1348f750d11482e94793cafb52b200ad19a9e3fda88c2304627f86d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9A818C79_BCA8_46DB_8D77_99A0AB587962"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫With constant prayer in my heart, I impatiently awaited the railroad’s opening ceremony."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしは祈るような心地で、⟪k:1⟫開通式典を待ちわびましたわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_69CAAA81_630D_42F6_8BE1_2427A5D15C72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 65347a15f2d6e3aa1595672683444eff5069638ad0354175669b612d58752349
#. default-sha256: 3688fa1fee2262c4c0a5c1b96c3174dae2a0e94030a4a2e33e6c93399c0e1657
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69CAAA81_630D_42F6_8BE1_2427A5D15C72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I do not, after all, wish for anyone to fall into any kind of misfortune..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくし、⟪k:1⟫本当は誰にも、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫不幸になどなって欲しくはないのですから……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7C82EAD2_E1F7_4235_A164_E19C0AD1C3ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1b93b264eee32492f1de562b99e156fe526dc356bcf89bc6ac0a2a32737f623a
#. default-sha256: 4be62d171fbcbbfeea18d2da25d3c892f21097b711833233d41a0b3d2035ed31
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7C82EAD2_E1F7_4235_A164_E19C0AD1C3ED"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that goes for you as well, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もちろん、⟪k:1⟫旦那さま。⟪k:2⟫あなた様にもですわ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B419369_3A6E_416B_8CD3_7BF4E12CB384
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17b5774225e143c38ceda356755e62fb3a2ddab5b3c951d5a61872a5fe077ff4
#. default-sha256: 74626b964cb2462f8e01f38518e33bf44f177f6aae3511d48886ad786991cabb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B419369_3A6E_416B_8CD3_7BF4E12CB384"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, Master... ⟪k:1⟫The door is soon to be shut upon this era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫さあ、⟪k:1⟫旦那さま……。⟪k:2⟫この時代の扉も、⟪k:3⟫終わりが近づいてまいりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A5EBDE59_069C_4707_A7D6_63C1CCC2AA45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdcf01c241b98a966dee8e98d8878457a90689388c9b2f7423862512e7ad2d87
#. default-sha256: afd4d808382dfcf36b4b9d2ee5377211593f1c9b88e9a278337569764669e495
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A5EBDE59_069C_4707_A7D6_63C1CCC2AA45"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Are you prepared to see what happens next?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I see. Very well."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫お心の準備はよろしいですか？⟪k:1⟫　そう、⟪k:2⟫そうですか……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D5AC5A40_6B95_41CC_81F9_2E678752541F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84e0bfac9afd0254b0809cb67a59ac3042e361d1dad983f1e21ea1f10c337664
#. default-sha256: 632a4d02b794ba217add0c359de55f68a7ac16699a0557f181dba09cee1fd60d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D5AC5A40_6B95_41CC_81F9_2E678752541F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Then allow us to make our way to that final day.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫See with your own eyes, Master, "
"how this tale concludes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――それでは、⟪k:1⟫最後の日へと向かいましょう。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫このお話の結末を、⟪k:4⟫あなた様自身の"
"目で、⟪k:5⟫見届けてくださいまし。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5CA27902_7BE1_4C88_B5E6_E3257157761D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 672f6f302556196e723bacb3e4be91f19df3aa1b58f97d76968bdb000b06bc29
#. default-sha256: f65214333c0f3658f4299504b85db2d4c813406223fe375530b75d4cfe947370
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5CA27902_7BE1_4C88_B5E6_E3257157761D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And please... ⟪k:1⟫do not let go of my hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうか……わたくしの手を、⟪k:1⟫離さないで。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_38183C3A_5A49_49E9_9078_137F657FA40A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42b23243448bba144af80291f7f6b8bea15cb0496e7c5f7425fb88a6725a1551
#. default-sha256: 2f34792a99b543c232f5896dd3506ae9b16e962d13f7842a00fad1234ecb8e90
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_38183C3A_5A49_49E9_9078_137F657FA40A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫.................."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫………………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D4A6FA98_A7C3_4324_8BC0_7853D9A17202
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67891c1abf7c1232f86eadcf0ff9daed03b890e1691b597747da4f9862ccf8f7
#. default-sha256: e1921c9bcff42dfa99e866d207ec6a3a7159a3730e5f4f6cad6ce3f97c776251
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D4A6FA98_A7C3_4324_8BC0_7853D9A17202"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The night before the opening ceremony, the master of the house headed for his wife’s shed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫大陸横断鉄道の開通式前夜、⟪k:1⟫館の主であるヤコポは、⟪k:2⟫妻の部屋へと向かっておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_00629B75_CB74_4C66_AEB9_43218111BC59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f6c9a2a2d83248e760694d1ab4dc8d4d4fa797404d8551faadb8e01cc79047b3
#. default-sha256: 0dad27092028fe94190d7b08dba376697cb1aa880e6b3252a546d55a57d240dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_00629B75_CB74_4C66_AEB9_43218111BC59"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a tension on his face, but a surety in his step.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He had found the resolve "
"to speak with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その表情はこわばっているものの、⟪k:1⟫足取りに迷いはございません。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼は向き合う覚悟を"
"決めておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_07151B49_FE0E_49DD_BCB1_6B1E509795E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5bafb5bc4b164fa161529ab6e1c1b750a5924f6dc67f393c6010bf2ae5019fc6
#. default-sha256: aa29c094957d8fc1e872505a1887d0422c91077e16eede33da7fdb80a5f1c76e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_07151B49_FE0E_49DD_BCB1_6B1E509795E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Having locked her away for so long in the shed like a common prisoner, Jacopo was hardly "
"optimistic about what she might say to him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫長い間、⟪k:1⟫幽閉のごとく部屋に閉じ込めていた妻が、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫自分を何と言うか――。⟪k:4⟫さすが"
"に楽観視はしていなかったでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74DF934A_2B1D_4AC2_A228_28F59D2EFD3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 673e6739b77d0daeb6d39e2c9ceb384356530fa21e5eb7f126043f056ee8fed1
#. default-sha256: cbab9bb2944dcc9e386768a4fef482795e6d0dd1e5fbeb38401a112223ce2e87
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74DF934A_2B1D_4AC2_A228_28F59D2EFD3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had undeniably mistreated her, said heartless and cruel things to her, and even gotten "
"physically violent with her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫手ひどい仕打ちをしたことも、⟪k:1⟫心無い言葉をぶつけたことも、⟪k:2⟫そして暴力を振るったこと"
"も、⟪k:3⟫すべて事実。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8AB2F328_F485_4FC7_83A6_FC5D21CE79D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5668944d313a953a038aac4a17058869df269d80420a2eb16a0ef4ee27f10fd
#. default-sha256: 16000dad8c8573f619b93a09ef34b25eb36fa68a1b13eccdf7906a4feb7e154b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8AB2F328_F485_4FC7_83A6_FC5D21CE79D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His actions were inexcusable, even if they were in response to her infidelity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫たとえ妻の不貞という出来事の上に成り立つ行為であっても、⟪k:1⟫許されるものではないでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_647B08CC_5594_438B_BA30_D4E9D0929645
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d7b90cc4f449051c78f2850fafa8bbfeb1aad3cc59460d9f288c518b359a55a
#. default-sha256: e3932e874abc77827b4074539476e36c335cecf40c6d59331ccad8fa891d4e6d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_647B08CC_5594_438B_BA30_D4E9D0929645"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Of course, the very infidelity which had driven him to such behavior had not, in fact, taken "
"place, but he was unaware of that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫もちろん、⟪k:1⟫その不貞そのものも、⟪k:2⟫誤解なのですけれど……。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫彼は気づいておりませ"
"んでしたから。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_385304CF_5B4C_49D0_90A2_B0F045A80595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8fd41c4101dfa2743b634dd4eafc30622bb43d5de58c00f67926c3ca7415fc05
#. default-sha256: a9f56962a73cf4e15f8ed15818a70fed9a40babcd3dc2cc170310423713a1c61
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_385304CF_5B4C_49D0_90A2_B0F045A80595"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was a chance they would never reconcile their misunderstandings, and that this "
"predicament would not have a positive resolution, but he still clung to a tiny fragment of hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫結局はこじれたまま、⟪k:1⟫最悪の結果となるかもしれない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それでも――、⟪k:4⟫一縷の望み"
"をかけて。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_23DE3C47_FF4D_4DD6_A52E_50ED583D252A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c80427f2528d30a91cc8ef7e8b0da8b523da9bdb19cad440292bece602b3b39
#. default-sha256: 64abb4ff62d8919d1153c61bd31daf4a381af38167d99b021ccb3abed7bed751
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_23DE3C47_FF4D_4DD6_A52E_50ED583D252A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He wanted to start over with the White-Haired Girl, to make a new future with her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫妻とやり直し、⟪k:1⟫未来を切り開いていきたいから。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_53EE63C7_F841_468E_ACF2_685521941970
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec304dbb6113a2c405448740ad5da1c3b7a3f2620d22c299ce5763fe6844c55d
#. default-sha256: cd2c6ef30d363a53dbc7d696df01cc62780c53bdc5cd018c2e77946d74825b91
